{"words": [{"text": "لَّا", "translation": "(Let) not"}, {"text": "يَتَّخِذِ", "translation": "take"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ", "translation": "the believers"}, {"text": "ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ", "translation": "the disbelievers"}, {"text": "أَوْلِيَآءَ", "translation": "(as) allies"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "دُونِ", "translation": "instead of"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ ۖ", "translation": "the believers"}, {"text": "وَمَن", "translation": "And whoever"}, {"text": "يَفْعَلْ", "translation": "does"}, {"text": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "فَلَيْسَ", "translation": "then not he (has)"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "شَىْءٍ", "translation": "anything"}, {"text": "إِلَّآ", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "تَتَّقُوا۟", "translation": "you fear"}, {"text": "مِنْهُمْ", "translation": "from them"}, {"text": "تُقَىٰةًۭ ۗ", "translation": "(as) a precaution"}, {"text": "وَيُحَذِّرُكُمُ", "translation": "And warns you"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "نَفْسَهُۥ ۗ", "translation": "(of) Himself"}, {"text": "وَإِلَى", "translation": "and to"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَصِيرُ", "translation": "(is) the final return"}], "sahih": "Let not believers take disbelievers as allies [i.e., supporters or protectors] rather than believers. And whoever [of you] does that has nothing [i.e., no association] with Allāh, except when taking precaution against them in prudence.1 And Allāh warns you of Himself, and to Allāh is the [final] destination."}